# AI requirements

The LLM is an explanation layer, not the source of truth.

Before calling an AI provider:

1. Calculate metrics deterministically.
2. Compare the player with an appropriate peer group.
3. Generate evidence-based findings with confidence levels.
4. Attach evidence from specific matches or aggregates.

Never ask the LLM to calculate statistics from raw matches. Never send API keys, emails, internal IDs, or unnecessary player identifiers to an AI provider.

Validate all AI responses against a Zod schema. Provide a deterministic fallback when the AI provider fails.

AI advice must be retrospective or educational — no live instructions during an active match.
